    "notes": [
      "Requires xdm_android_uix_r3_downloads_add_workspace_overlay.zip as its direct baseline; validated user baseline commit is 3eb4ef1.",
      "Media leads with Paste page URL, private-session guidance, reviewable captures, common quality chips, complete video/audio/subtitle selection, estimated size, explicit download, and recently queued progress.",
      "Library leads with playable media, All/Video/Audio/Recently added filters, compact list or adaptive grid, and Play/Resume/Retry/More actions.",
      "Resolver history, raw media/session values, Termux controls, dispatch plans, telemetry, worker bridges, privacy audits, validation decks, sidecar JSON, and routine player diagnostics stay out of normal Media and Library surfaces.",
      "Redacted player support details appear only after an actual playback error.",
      "Room schema 14, versionName 0.20.0-rc08, versionCode 21, routes, engines, queue policy, scheduler, recovery, external handoff, resolver persistence, and developer diagnostics are unchanged.",
      "UIX R5 is the next overlay and redesigns Activity, Settings, and the Developer options boundary."
